  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1c0d74d81f2fe105",
      "translationZh": "在 Claude Code Remote 会话（云端和自托管运行器）中添加了快速模式：主机的快速模式设置或在会话中输入 /fast 将在您的组织允许的范围内生效。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8189f5fd77de15eb",
      "translationZh": "在全屏模式下的 /config 面板中添加了鼠标支持：滚轮滚动设置列表，点击设置值可更改它，指针所在的行会被高亮显示。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bdf6058297fa9242",
      "translationZh": "添加了 claude self-hosted-runner --drain-marker-file <path> 参数：当该文件在 SIGTERM 排水时存在时，运行器将其退出报告给服务器作为主机排水（仅遥测）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "89a42767ce2470e1",
      "translationZh": "在具有沙箱的自动模式下，为 Bash、PowerShell 和 Monitor 添加了 per-command allowed_domains：命令所需的主机会与其一起被审查并仅为其打开；其他主机将被拒绝。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7d40750cbb5ed5a6",
      "translationZh": "在 agent 前置元数据和 --agents JSON 中添加了 omitClaudeMd，使得自定义和插件子代理可以在没有用户、项目和本地 CLAUDE.md 文件的情况下运行；托管的策略文件仍会加载。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8b09c40756097395",
      "translationZh": "为 claude plugin install 和 claude plugin update 添加了 --accept-command <sha256> 参数，以接受之前 --json 运行显示的确切命令，而不是使用 -y。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0ffdabc587b27ad7",
      "translationZh": "在 modelPricing 托管设置和 Claude apps 网关定价块中添加了对大于 1、最高可达 10 的乘数的支持，用于标记的内部回收费率。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7ff68315d748e9e9",
      "translationZh": "添加了指向 Bedrock、Vertex AI、Foundry 和 LLM 网关用户的旋转提示，引导他们使用 Claude 桌面应用；claude.ai 桌面应用提示现在建议使用 /desktop ，该选项提供下载应用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5977e6f57dcd3cfd",
      "translationZh": "修复了在切换账户、组织或 API 密钥后，缓存的组织策略被重复使用，且在凭据在会话中途更改时，策略不会在每小时检查之前刷新的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d253afd639f3beb0",
      "translationZh": "修复了在启动后或会话中途组织策略加载完成时，工具和命令列表未更新的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "09c4caff1dc83e7d",
      "translationZh": "修复了企业托管的 managed-mcp.json 无法读取或解析时被忽略的问题：现在它会保持独占的 MCP 控制（用户、项目和插件服务器不加载），并在启动时发出警告。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "24e20f15f8393472",
      "translationZh": "修复了通过 ANTHROPIC_UNIX_SOCKET 设置的第三方本地代理获取并拒绝组织策略的问题：这些代理现在再次被视为其他自定义网关，包括用于远程控制。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7009c65622ad67b5",
      "translationZh": "修复了在会话的工作进程重启后应用工作流或代理批准时，云会话拒绝每个子代理工具调用（\\\"updatedInput … failed schema validation\\\")的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "326217c3ef601148",
      "translationZh": "修复了在组织已禁用快速模式时，/fast off 指令返回 \\\"Fast mode unavailable\\\" 而不是关闭快速模式的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "184f23b92af6260c",
      "translationZh": "修复了以 CLAUDE_CODE_SKIP_FAST_MODE_ORG_CHECK 启动的会话在 API 拒绝快速模式后，每轮重新发送快速请求的问题：现在拒绝生效并显示其原因。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "809fb5fc5ca97247",
      "translationZh": "修复了在 CLAUDE_CODE_RETRY_WATCHDOG 下的快速模式在使用额度限制时导致回合失败，或在过载时以快速速度重试，而不是回退到标准速度的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "afa598c2e525ce09",
      "translationZh": "修复了 Bash 权限检查，当 fmt、column 等命令在其后跟着一个检查器不识别的选项时，会遗漏这些命令读取的文件。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a507acf53c5b1470",
      "translationZh": "修复了 Bash 权限检查，当通配符位于命令的模式或选项值中时，会跳过通配符展开后的文件（例如 grep -v dir/* file）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bebf84c72ca922f2",
      "translationZh": "修复了 Bash 权限检查，使得 shell 变量声明标志不能误表示正在运行的命令。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e45ce89187e018c2",
      "translationZh": "修复了在 bypass 和 auto 模式下，permissions.blockReadsOutsideWorkingDirectories 导致的 Bash 命令（包含两次目录切换、子 shell，或 cd + git 链）跳过提示的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f92e7f75dcb1d1a2",
      "translationZh": "修复了 Linux 上沙盒命令启动失败后，陈旧的 .git/config.lock 导致 git checkout -b、git push -u 和 git config 在会话剩余时间中失效的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ff1da99037feacbe",
      "translationZh": "修复了在 macOS 系统文件事件服务饱和的机器上，会话外的设置文件更改未被察觉的问题；现在观察者会回退到轮询。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
