      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cf265d53808efb33",
      "translationZh": "修复了 claude -p 会话恢复时，若所有工具均来自 MCP 服务器，则因出现 \"At least one tool must have defer_loading=false\" 错误而失败的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
