      "translationZh": "修复了当 LLM 网关将非流式回复作为 text/plain 返回时，导致轮次因 \"API returned an empty or malformed response\" 而失败的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
