      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "578774c527af7d74",
      "translationZh": "终端渲染性能得到改进：大型差异和长转录渲染更快，慢帧更少",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d70ace2899ad95f4",
      "translationZh": "通过在每次启动时跳过对内置模型数据的冗余验证，启动时间略有改善",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "96b305fbe7628172",
      "translationZh": "改进了钩子反馈：在 SessionStart、UserPromptSubmit、PreToolUse 或 SessionEnd 钩子运行时，旋转器会显示已用时间，并且 Esc 可以取消等待 SessionStart 钩子的提示",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "30565ccb7bc93621",
      "translationZh": "改进了长时间思考时的旋转器状态：经过 45 秒后它会显示 \"deep in thought\"，而在从输出令牌限制恢复时会显示 \"picking the thought back up\"",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e64f2aee3786826d",
      "translationZh": "改进了动态工作流：在达到使用限制时暂停，在限制重置后自动继续，而不是丢弃受影响的代理",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5a19efdf39a3d509",
      "translationZh": "改进了 Remote Control：在不稳定网络上设置失败时， claude.ai 上会留下更少的空会话",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "da18651f3a1b8ac1",
      "translationZh": "改进了云会话中浏览器无法连接时的 Chrome 中 Claude 消息：现在会先提示电脑可能处于休眠状态，然后再建议安装",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "406beb008e4042e5",
      "translationZh": "改进了 claude mcp serve：正在运行的工具调用现在每 30 秒发送一次进度更新，使客户端显示其仍在运行，且空闲超时不会中止不输出内容的长命令",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "db9cdf667f1bbab4",
      "translationZh": "改进了 Foundry 和 Claude Platform 在 AWS 上的会话：一个 alwaysLoad MCP 服务器在对话中途完成连接后，在下一轮可直接使用，无需进行工具搜索往返。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "44af465314d5a9fb",
      "translationZh": "改进了作为工件发布的 Markdown 文件：它们现在会渲染为带样式的文档页面（标题头、文档排版、语法高亮代码）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4ed099b9aaf2d62e",
      "translationZh": "改进了 Artifact 工具的发布错误：当发布时没有文件时，现在会提示先将页面写入文件；不支持的文件类型会在报告缺失的 favicon 之前被报告。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "968c871d1a057596",
      "translationZh": "改进了 Artifact 工具在页面声明的能力其合约版本不具有时的错误：现在会列出所有受支持的能力，并指出在较新的合约版本中是否具备该能力。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d1cd22da3ae59c0a",
      "translationZh": "改进了工件监视：一个会话现在可以一次监视最多 10 个已发布的工件（用于其他地方的重新发布），之前上限为 5。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6913fe1c9654fffb",
      "translationZh": "改进了 PDF @-mentions：当 pdfinfo 无法计算页数时，现在会显示 \"页数未知\"，而不是根据文件大小猜测的页数。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5a72531759b5d552",
      "translationZh": "改进了 /mobile：现在会显示一个针对 claude.ai/mobile 的 QR 码，扫描后会打开适用于您手机的正确应用商店。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c6485027777e8835",
      "translationZh": "已更改自动模式，使得技能或斜杠命令的内联 ! shell 命令遵循默认模式的权限规则，而不是分类器；没有规则决定的命令将作为审查过的工具调用运行。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9ec5cb04b03c14d7",
      "translationZh": "将自动模式更改为：子代理通过专用的回调调用向其调用者报告，该回调由安全分类器进行审查，而不是事后审查其最后一条消息。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c47ee924fdd791a5",
      "translationZh": "将 Monitor 监视更改为始终具有截止时间（最多 30 分钟；单提示 -p 运行为 10 分钟），并通知 Claude 重新武装，替换了无超时持久选项。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3e6e34ca79622ebd",
      "translationZh": "将提示中的 IDE 选择指示器更改为一个 [⧉ …] 药丸，该药丸随文本换行而不是压缩多行提示；使用 Backspace 删除它以使选择保持未选中状态。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5d166292ea28f083",
      "translationZh": "将专业计划的默认动态工作流大小调整为小，并将中等大小指南从 15 个代理降低到 10 个代理。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fdcab58d74b5321b",
      "translationZh": "更改了 Claude 应用网关、Bedrock、Vertex AI 和 Foundry 会话，使其不再刷新会话未使用的剩余 claude.ai 登录。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "501c58bd0269eef2",
      "translationZh": "更新了捆绑的 claude-api 技能，以在流式自定义工具上启用 eager_input_streaming，并开始使用 user.define_outcome 进行可交付成果形状的 Managed Agents 工作。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "008be8e7a9af1d42",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 添加了一个“附加打开文件”设置，当其关闭时，停止将打开的文件添加到消息中；选中的文本仍会被附加。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dbd76334bd26f3ed",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 修复了 Hooks 和 Permission 规则对话框报告保存失败的问题，以及在仅插件策略锁定下 Hooks 对话框变为空白或在保存错误中显示颜色代码的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
