      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c74626c58f9a1960",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 修复了当工作区位于 Windows 映射网络驱动器或 SUBST 驱动器时，会话历史记录仅显示当前会话的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
