      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f815323cdd537c23",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 修复了在 environmentVariables 设置中 CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR 更改后，打开的标签页和侧边栏在窗口重新加载之前仍保持旧配置文件夹的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
