    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a2c458da5711ebdf",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 修复了在 Windows 上扩展运行后台命令（如 git、ripgrep 和登录状态检查）时控制台窗口闪烁的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
