    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "323c64e05e93c30f",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 将切换开关的开启状态从 Claude 橙色改为编辑器主题的按钮颜色",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "59b5e3ca88018d5b",
      "translationZh": "[Claude Code on the web] 修复了云会话在其进程退出后有时需要大约十分钟才能响应的问题，而此时会话仍显示为活跃状态；现在发送消息会立即重启它",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4044cf86932ed53e",
      "translationZh": "[Claude Code on the web] 将 claude.ai/code 上的 Routines 页面改为新布局，包含 Yours 和 Templates 标签页以及显示运行状态的两列常规卡片，并移除了其日历视图",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
