      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9cd4757431367273",
      "translationZh": "[Claude Code on the web] 在管理员设置的 Cloud environments 编辑器中添加了自定义网络访问选项，使用与 claude.ai/code 上的环境对话框相同的 allowed-domains 列表",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f9e099d7f4229416",
      "translationZh": "[Claude Code on the web] 改进了 Cloud environments 管理页面：它显示 Claude Tag 和 Claude Code 的默认环境，并提供更改链接，同时标记出推荐创建的类型",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cd6628b416305330",
      "translationZh": "[Claude Tag] 修复了在频道中 Claude 长时间保持活跃时，当对话主要在线程中进行时，大约每小时会丢失其工作上下文的问题；现在线程活动会防止其被重置",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "88bf7bce690a087e",
      "translationZh": "[Claude Tag] 修复了在要求 Claude 监视拉取请求的线程中，Claude 在该线程重启后不再收到 CI 失败、评论和审查的通知的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e78b2fd9ee8d8240",
      "translationZh": "[Claude Tag] 修复了删除 Claude 已在其中回复的线程的第一条消息不会结束 Claude 在该线程中的工作的问题；现在它会停止，就像删除没有回复的消息时一样",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "752fc79b53f8471f",
      "translationZh": "[Claude Tag] 修复了 Claude 因之前的指令是针对其他机器人或助手而阻止发布帖子的问题；只有发送给 Claude 的指令才会约束它，当不确定时它会询问。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "565807ae72796db1",
      "translationZh": "[Claude Tag] 修复了 Claude 在加入繁忙频道时发布的回复模式卡片，该卡片在频道仅仅是聊天活跃或人数多时会说它“看到很多自动帖子”；现在卡片会给出真实原因。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "db809f9ce288ed9d",
      "translationZh": "[Claude Tag] 改进了 Claude Tag 管理设置中的环境选择器：选项标注为 Anthropic-hosted 或 self-hosted，并提供编辑该环境或创建新环境的链接。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fa278ff7806d9700",
      "translationZh": "[Code Review] 修复了在每次 PR 只审查一次的仓库中，当提交到达而审查尚未开始时，拉取请求有时得不到审查的问题；现在它会审查请求的提交。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "703a47dd0bd050c1",
      "translationZh": "[Code Review] 修复了 Code Review 有时会因 GitHub 报告其已创建的审查出现错误而重复发布相同发现两次或三次的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "55851a686fe6eec7",
      "translationZh": "[Code Review] 修复了后续审查在后来的推送移动了其锚定的代码行时，会重新发布已经被人解决的安全发现的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "516f90982d79b3ca",
      "translationZh": "[Code Review] 修复了在 Claude 应用中重新打开已完成的 /ultrareview 云会话时，会未经提示地重新开始整个审查的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
